### Necessário para pegar o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:41000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "UserName": "qwe",
    "Password": "qwe"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### teste de buscar todas as contas do plano de contas
GET http://localhost:41000/getAllPlanoContas HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de buscar conta por ID
GET http://localhost:41000/getPlanoContaByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de inserção de conta
POST http://localhost:41000/insertPlanoConta HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "codigo": "2.2.02",
    "descricao": "Manutenção de máquinas",
    "tipo": "Despesa",
    "ativo": true
}

### teste de atualização de conta
PUT http://localhost:41000/updatePlanoConta/7 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "codigo": "2.2.01",
    "descricao": "Material de escritório e limpeza",
    "tipo": "Despesa",
    "ativo": true
}

### teste de remoção (soft delete) de conta
DELETE http://localhost:41000/deletePlanoConta/7 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste sem token (deve ser bloqueado)
GET http://localhost:41000/getAllPlanoContas HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
